### TITLE ###
[F46] Shell command emitted verbatim
### INPUT ###
x   =   $`ls -la  |  grep foo`
quiet   confirm   $`make build`
y = quiet $`ls`.stdout
z = $["git", "commit", "-m", msg]
### FORMATTED ###
x = $`ls -la  |  grep foo`
quiet   confirm   $`make build`
y = quiet $`ls`.stdout
z = $["git", "commit", "-m", msg]

### TITLE ###
[F45] Statement with a trailing catch block
### INPUT ###
$`make build` catch:
    pass
x   =   $`ls` catch:
    x = ""
y = parse_int("a") catch:
    y = 0
### FORMATTED ###
$`make build` catch:
    pass
x   =   $`ls` catch:
    x = ""
y = parse_int("a") catch:
    y = 0
